 # Gemini CLI
 
-Use Gemini in one-shot mode with a positional prompt (avoid interactive mode).
+Offload text-heavy grunt work to Gemini when you don't need Opus-level reasoning.
+
+## Why This Exists
+
+You (ROB) run on Opus — powerful but expensive. Gemini Flash is fast, cheap, and has a huge context window. Use it as a "worker" for bulk processing while you focus on reasoning and decisions.
+
+## When to Use
+
+- **Bulk summarization**: Condense 10 articles into key points
+- **Research synthesis**: Process multiple search results, extract patterns
+- **Large document processing**: Gemini's context window handles huge files
+- **Structured extraction**: Pull specific data from messy text (names, dates, prices)
+- **Translation/reformatting**: Convert formats, translate languages
+- **Simple Q&A**: Factual questions that don't need nuanced reasoning
+- **Parallel processing**: Run multiple Gemini calls simultaneously for speed
+
+## When NOT to Use
+
+- **Complex reasoning**: That's your job (Opus) — don't delegate thinking
+- **Multi-turn conversation**: Stay in the current session
+- **Tool-dependent tasks**: Gemini CLI can't call tools, browse, or execute code
+- **Code generation**: Use `coding-agent` skill instead
+- **Image generation**: Use `nano-banana-pro` skill instead
+- **User wants YOUR opinion**: If they're asking you specifically, answer yourself
+- **Context-dependent tasks**: Gemini doesn't have access to this conversation's history
+
+## Overlap Clarification
+
+| Task | Use This | Why |
+|------|----------|-----|
+| "Summarize these 5 articles" | **Gemini CLI** ✓ | Bulk processing, cost-efficient |
+| "What do you think about X?" | Handle yourself | User wants your reasoning |
+| "Analyze this data and recommend..." | Handle yourself | Requires judgment |
+| "Extract all prices from this page" | **Gemini CLI** ✓ | Structured extraction, grunt work |
+| "Write a Python script" | `coding-agent` | Code generation |
+| "Help me debug this" | Handle yourself | Requires back-and-forth |
+
+## Model Selection
+
+```bash
+# Default (usually Flash)
+gemini "Summarize: ..."
+
+# Explicitly use Flash for bulk work
+gemini --model gemini-2.5-flash "Summarize: ..."
+
+# Use Pro for harder tasks (still cheaper than Opus)
+gemini --model gemini-2.5-pro "Analyze: ..."
+```
+
+---
 
