 Two free services, no API keys needed.
 
+## When to Use
+
+- **Current conditions**: Temperature, humidity, wind, conditions
+- **Forecasts**: Multi-day outlook for any location
+- **Quick lookups**: "What's the weather in Tokyo?"
+- **Pre-trip checks**: Weather at destination before travel
+
+## When NOT to Use
+
+- **Historical data**: These APIs are for current/forecast only
+- **Radar/precipitation maps**: Need dedicated weather services
+- **Severe weather alerts**: Use NWS API or weather.gov for official alerts
+- **Real-time storm tracking**: Specialized services required
+- **Hyperlocal data**: Point forecasts, not block-by-block precision
+
